.marketing
  section.feature-section(aria-labelledby="terms-title")
    .container.section-intro
      p.marketing-kicker Orbit · illustrative product content
      h1#terms-title= saas.legal.termsTitle
      p This page is a design example only. It does not create a contract or describe a currently available service.
      h2 About this demonstration
      p Orbit is a fictional product concept used to demonstrate static pages and reusable interface blocks. The pages do not create accounts, accept payments, or transmit form entries.
      h2 Using the sample interface
      p You may explore the links and visual controls in this repository. Disabled account fields and local-only pricing interactions are examples for review, not production services.
      h2 Production terms
      p A real product would need terms reviewed for its operator, jurisdiction, billing model, data handling, and support commitments before launch.
      p
        a.marketing-text-link(href=route('saas.privacy')) Read the privacy overview #[span(aria-hidden="true") →]
